{"id":"f10t2","name":"Billable Seat-Days","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","seat_events_df","month"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>The SaaS platform now bills customers per <b>seat-day</b>: a seat costs one unit for every calendar day of the month on which it was active, even for a few minutes. Finance asks you to compute the bill of a given <code>month</code> (a string <code>YYYY-MM</code>) from the seat audit log.</p>\n<p><code>seat_events_df</code> has the columns <code>tenant</code>, <code>user</code> (strings), <code>action</code> (string) and <code>at</code> (timestamp). When an admin gives a seat to a user, the log records <code>add</code>; when the seat is taken back, it records <code>remove</code>. The log comes from several application servers, so the same event can appear twice, and the case of <code>action</code> is not reliable. Other actions (for example <code>rename</code>) say nothing about the seat and must be ignored.</p>\n<p>A seat becomes active at an <code>add</code> and stays active until the next <code>remove</code> of the same user in the same tenant. Admins sometimes click <code>add</code> again on a user who already has a seat: this changes nothing. Likewise, a <code>remove</code> for a user who has no active seat changes nothing. If a seat is still active when the log ends, it is active until the end of the month; a seat that became active before the month and was not removed counts from the first day of the month. Only days inside <code>month</code> are billed.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return one row per tenant with at least one billable seat-day in <code>month</code>, with the columns <code>tenant</code>, <code>seat_days</code> (long, the number of (user, day) pairs that are billed) and <code>users</code> (long, the number of distinct users with at least one billed day), sorted by <code>tenant</code>. If an <code>add</code> and a <code>remove</code> of a user have exactly the same timestamp, the <code>add</code> happened first.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p><code>seat_events_df</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>tenant</th><th>user</th><th>action</th><th>at</th></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>ana</td><td>add</td><td>2026-02-20 10:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>bob</td><td>ADD</td><td>2026-03-03 23:50:00</td></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>bob</td><td>remove</td><td>2026-03-05 00:10:00</td></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>bob</td><td>remove</td><td>2026-03-05 00:10:00</td></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>cy</td><td>add</td><td>2026-03-10 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>cy</td><td>add</td><td>2026-03-12 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>cy</td><td>rename</td><td>2026-03-13 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>cy</td><td>remove</td><td>2026-03-14 08:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>globex</td><td>dan</td><td>remove</td><td>2026-03-01 08:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>globex</td><td>eve</td><td>add</td><td>2026-04-01 00:00:00</td></tr></table></div><p><code>month = \"2026-03\"</code></p><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>tenant</th><th>seat_days</th><th>users</th></tr><tr><td>acme</td><td>39</td><td>3</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\nfrom pyspark.sql.window import Window\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, seat_events_df: DataFrame, month: str) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return seat_events_df\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["consigne longue","intervalles actifs","jours couverts","règles implicites"],"minutes":22,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"seat_events_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"tenant string, user string, action string, at timestamp","rows":[["acme","ana","add","2026-02-20 10:00:00"],["acme","bob","ADD","2026-03-03 23:50:00"],["acme","bob","remove","2026-03-05 00:10:00"],["acme","bob","remove","2026-03-05 00:10:00"],["acme","cy","add","2026-03-10 09:00:00"],["acme","cy","add","2026-03-12 09:00:00"],["acme","cy","rename","2026-03-13 09:00:00"],["acme","cy","remove","2026-03-14 08:00:00"],["globex","dan","remove","2026-03-01 08:00:00"],["globex","eve","add","2026-04-01 00:00:00"]]}},"month":"2026-03"},"expected":{"columns":["tenant","seat_days","users"],"rows":[["acme",39,3]]}},{"input":{"seat_events_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"tenant string, user string, action string, at timestamp","rows":[["t","u","add","2026-02-27 12:00:00"],["t","u","remove","2026-02-27 12:00:00"],["t","v","add","2026-02-28 12:00:00"],["t","v","remove","2026-03-02 00:00:00"],["t","w"," Add ","2026-01-31 12:00:00"]]}},"month":"2026-02"},"expected":{"columns":["tenant","seat_days","users"],"rows":[["t",30,3]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}